English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 1
1 This Ordinance applies to:
a. audit firms that provide audit services to public interest entities and are subject to the oversight of the Federal Audit Oversight Authority;
b. audit firms that have voluntarily subjected themselves to the oversight of the Oversight Authority.
2 It regulates:
a. the auditing standards that must be complied with when audit services are provided;
b. the Oversight Authority’s procedure for inspecting audit firms under state oversight.
|

:NOTE
Para. 1 let. a — Amended by No I of the FAOA O of 10 Nov. 2014, in force since 1 Jan. 2015 (AS 2014 4093).

